  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds chicken wings, cut apart at joints, wing tips discarded",
    "0.5 cup soy sauce",
    "0.5 cup Italian-style salad dressing",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "0.25 cup hot pepper sauce (such as Frank's RedHot®), or to taste",
    "1 teaspoon soy sauce"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To prepare the wings: Combine chicken wings, soy sauce, and Italian dressing in a large resealable plastic bag; coat chicken wings with marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator, 4 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Nz5jxGzczAEBn3vYfKgHXBWQgBM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213068-grill-master-chicken-wings-mfs-step-1-b80a5f0f14b9481dac7653ac78f7b76e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213068/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the spicy sauce: Melt butter in a small saucepan over low heat; stir in hot pepper sauce and soy sauce until combined. Remove from heat and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qot__EnNMRfxMmene5cLRbUhKBg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213068-grill-master-chicken-wings-mfs-step-2-48724ab95ac8414cb4a7d3976f983107.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213068/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken wings from marinade and pat dry; discard any remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5sYQo9DONrgP3Il-f8j4KWzVhDs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213068-grill-master-chicken-wings-mfs-step-3-a29e8c5e4ba14499beac5a7c4488c3f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213068/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on the preheated grill, turning occasionally, until chicken is golden brown and no longer pink inside, 25 to 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lqkHAxx6eItpRtjXq21px1uM50c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213068-grill-master-chicken-wings-mfs-step-4-453adea9ffb3436b9d70fca738befa8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213068/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place grilled wings in a large bowl. Pour prepared spicy butter sauce over wings; toss until well-coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CeZAJHBIZv_AlY11H-qE6VKjbuo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213068-grill-master-chicken-wings-DDMFS-4x3-93c8ba1b32f140f3b688689ceccb68fa.jpg"
      ],
